{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Colonies x Grand Strategy</h2>Fusing the intuitive management of Colony-Build games with the clear competitive stakes and vast scale of Grand Strategy.<br>Dive into diverse breakthrough tactics:<br>Early Rush \u2022 Cultural Expansion \u2022 Trade/Slavery \u2022 Migration \u2022 Enforce other tribes to tribute or become your vassal.<br>Combine these approaches, restarting to conquer new paths after each victory.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1876880/extras/995c24f6cba550ac76fbf369908ab805.webp?t=1770259350\" alt=\"\u200cAncient Nations Competition\u200c\" width=606 height=46 /></span><br>We added simple grand strategy gameplay to colony-building mechanics.<br>You will lead a branch of \u200cAncient Chinese, starting by building a small tribe: crafting tools, constructing houses, hunting, farming, and raising livestock.<br>Then face 5 ethnic groups in Asia: \u200cRongdi, Baiyue, Ancient Chinese States, Aryans, Assyrians\u200c.<br>From the eastern Yellow River basin to Mesopotamia \u2013 rule or be ruled.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1876880/extras/516f86e01be7d56a3a912956ae439260.webp?t=1770259350\" alt=\"\u200cTech Tree &amp; Culture Tree\u200c\" width=606 height=46 /></span><br>Through war, cultural promotion, and migration, increase your influence over other tribes.<br>Make other tribes submit, pay tribute, and provide you with slaves, armies, and resources.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1876880/extras/bdaa2131712c043d1c637a2015f38139.webp?t=1770259350\" alt=\"\u200cManage Slaves\u200c\" width=606 height=46 /></span><br>Gain advanced tools and bronze through technological advantage for trade.<br>Or prioritize reproduction through \u200cfertility worship\u200c.<br>Or embrace violence, train professional soldiers, and plunder extensively.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1876880/extras/cffdc8b5652c1dc26aa15854978c2e3d.webp?t=1770259350\" alt=\"\u200cLeaders &amp; Grouping\u200c\" width=606 height=46 /></span><br>Use Leaders to manage groups, reducing repetitive actions.<br>Set group schedules: labor, create culture, develop tech, or train.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1876880/extras/4367c71debb4e6f6a8ed67138966124f.webp?t=1770259350\" alt=\"\u200cKnowledge Inheritance\u200c\" width=606 height=46 /></span><br>Leaders gain battlefield experience and can be promoted to nobles. Noble ranks unlock unique unit types, attire, and room facilities.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1876880/extras/c05158b79c1dc3d5348fe63a11f15bea.webp?t=1770259350\" width=606 height=46 /></span><br>This is the shared morale of a unit. When any member is attacked, in addition to taking damage, it also reduces the unit's overall organization. When a leader's unit reaches 0 organization, the entire unit will rout. You can improve organization by enhancing training, mood, and noble rank. You can also increase organization damage, which is an effective winning strategy besides directly killing enemies.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1876880/extras/afb0fa0b1571955b8f8dc159d1d88ebd.webp?t=1770259350\" width=606 height=46 /></span><br>Construct specialized rooms to meet tribal needs:<br>Bedrooms, slave quarters, kitchens, meeting halls, granaries, execution grounds, and altars.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1876880/extras/8726de8566383e6535e685b6aa51eaa8.webp?t=1770259350\" width=606 height=46 /></span><br>Force lifelong labor, OR adopt them into your tribe to bear children.<br>Execute slaves to suppress rebellions, OR sell them directly.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1876880/extras/e3b4a86ffed602a3ea4cac14eac2f884.webp?t=1770259350\" width=606 height=46 /></span><br>Tribesmen gain knowledge through labor \u2013 lost when they die.<br>Must carve knowledge onto stone monuments to preserve it.<br>These monuments become learning tools for future generations.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1876880?t=1770259350","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1876880?t=1770259350","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1876880/ba4d92f1598bc151d9c3f50df3ac1f1736918fb6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770259350","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1876880/ba4d92f1598bc151d9c3f50df3ac1f1736918fb6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770259350","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Community</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Colonies x Grand Strategy</h2>Fusing the intuitive management of Colony-Build games with the clear competitive stakes and vast scale of Grand Strategy.<br>Dive into diverse breakthrough tactics:<br>Early Rush \u2022 Cultural Expansion \u2022 Trade/Slavery \u2022 Migration \u2022 Enforce other tribes to tribute or become your vassal.<br>Combine these approaches, restarting to conquer new paths after each victory.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1876880/extras/995c24f6cba550ac76fbf369908ab805.webp?t=1770259350\" alt=\"\u200cAncient Nations Competition\u200c\" width=606 height=46 /></span><br>We added simple grand strategy gameplay to colony-building mechanics.<br>You will lead a branch of \u200cAncient Chinese, starting by building a small tribe: crafting tools, constructing houses, hunting, farming, and raising livestock.<br>Then face 5 ethnic groups in Asia: \u200cRongdi, Baiyue, Ancient Chinese States, Aryans, Assyrians\u200c.<br>From the eastern Yellow River basin to Mesopotamia \u2013 rule or be ruled.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1876880/extras/516f86e01be7d56a3a912956ae439260.webp?t=1770259350\" alt=\"\u200cTech Tree &amp; Culture Tree\u200c\" width=606 height=46 /></span><br>Through war, cultural promotion, and migration, increase your influence over other tribes.<br>Make other tribes submit, pay tribute, and provide you with slaves, armies, and resources.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1876880/extras/bdaa2131712c043d1c637a2015f38139.webp?t=1770259350\" alt=\"\u200cManage Slaves\u200c\" width=606 height=46 /></span><br>Gain advanced tools and bronze through technological advantage for trade.<br>Or prioritize reproduction through \u200cfertility worship\u200c.<br>Or embrace violence, train professional soldiers, and plunder extensively.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1876880/extras/cffdc8b5652c1dc26aa15854978c2e3d.webp?t=1770259350\" alt=\"\u200cLeaders &amp; Grouping\u200c\" width=606 height=46 /></span><br>Use Leaders to manage groups, reducing repetitive actions.<br>Set group schedules: labor, create culture, develop tech, or train.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1876880/extras/4367c71debb4e6f6a8ed67138966124f.webp?t=1770259350\" alt=\"\u200cKnowledge Inheritance\u200c\" width=606 height=46 /></span><br>Leaders gain battlefield experience and can be promoted to nobles. Noble ranks unlock unique unit types, attire, and room facilities.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1876880/extras/c05158b79c1dc3d5348fe63a11f15bea.webp?t=1770259350\" width=606 height=46 /></span><br>This is the shared morale of a unit. When any member is attacked, in addition to taking damage, it also reduces the unit's overall organization. When a leader's unit reaches 0 organization, the entire unit will rout. You can improve organization by enhancing training, mood, and noble rank. You can also increase organization damage, which is an effective winning strategy besides directly killing enemies.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1876880/extras/afb0fa0b1571955b8f8dc159d1d88ebd.webp?t=1770259350\" width=606 height=46 /></span><br>Construct specialized rooms to meet tribal needs:<br>Bedrooms, slave quarters, kitchens, meeting halls, granaries, execution grounds, and altars.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1876880/extras/8726de8566383e6535e685b6aa51eaa8.webp?t=1770259350\" width=606 height=46 /></span><br>Force lifelong labor, OR adopt them into your tribe to bear children.<br>Execute slaves to suppress rebellions, OR sell them directly.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1876880/extras/e3b4a86ffed602a3ea4cac14eac2f884.webp?t=1770259350\" width=606 height=46 /></span><br>Tribesmen gain knowledge through labor \u2013 lost when they die.<br>Must carve knowledge onto stone monuments to preserve it.<br>These monuments become learning tools for future generations.","developers":["YSH BigDove"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1876880/e5f4f4d4a65fc95f04d101b869e4a663428ae363/header.jpg?t=1770259350","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1876880/854497999/0e19b64d465b7c91f5f4180820167ea639da484c/1766720448/dash_av1.mpd?t=1766730738","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1876880/854497999/0e19b64d465b7c91f5f4180820167ea639da484c/1766720448/dash_h264.mpd?t=1766730738","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1876880/854497999/0e19b64d465b7c91f5f4180820167ea639da484c/1766720448/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1766730738","id":257163347,"name":"trailer_EN","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257163347/0995535f3b4f95c5b2ce25ee341817cf4184c7fe/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1766730738"}],"name":"Primitive Society Simulator","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"Primitive Society Simulator - <span class=\"discount_original_price\">$19.99</span> $15.99 USD","packageid":675767,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":"-20% ","price_in_cents_with_discount":1599}],"title":"Buy Primitive Society Simulator"}],"packages":[675767],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><